+ *  MBEDTLS_SSL_VERIFY_OPTIONAL:  peer certificate is checked, however the
+ *                        handshake continues even if verification failed;
+ *                        mbedtls_ssl_get_verify_result() can be called after the
+ *                        handshake is complete.
