+ *                 i.e. the function passed to \c mbedtls_ssl_conf_psk_cb().
+ *
+ * \note           An opaque PSK set by this function takes precedence over an
+ *                 opaque PSK configured by \c mbedtls_ssl_conf_psk_opaque().
